      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "```text\nOperation:      FPn ÷ Source → FPn\n```",
      "bbox": [
        262,
        396,
        1201,
        466
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0058_seg_004"
    },
    {
      "type": "code_block",
      "continuation": false,
      "heading_level": null,
      "md_text": "```text\nAssembler      FDIV. < fmt > < ea > ,FPn\nSyntax:        FDIV.X FPm,FPn\n               *FrDIV. < fmt > < ea > ,FPn\n               *FrDIV.X FPm,FPn\n               where r is rounding precision, S or D\n```",
      "bbox": [
        262,
        504,
        1535,
        808
      ],
      "segment_id": "page_0058_seg_005"
    },
    {
      "type": "footnote",
      "continuation": false,
